            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Obesity is one of the main risk factors for developing impaired glucose tolerance and type 2 diabetes in the youth. The patients are at high risk for cardiovascular complications. Yet, meeting therapeutical goals is hard to achieve in many children and adolescents.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
